OL,3,GNEWSACouncil inspectors find 'misogyny
OL,4,Aand bullying' culture
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommissioners could be working at
OL,7,FBedford Borough Council for the next
OL,8,Fthree years after a government
OL,9,Finspection found evidence of a bullying
OL,10,Fand misogynistic culture across
OL,11,Fpolitical groups on the authority.
OL,13,FIt found a blame culture within the
OL,14,Forganisation and accused Conservative
OL,15,FMayor Tom Wootton of "avoiding
OL,16,Fdifficult decisions and conflict".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
