OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil inspectors find 'misogyny
OL,4,Aand bullying' culture
OL,5,
OL,6,FWootton said: "I understand the
OL,7,Ffindings will concern residents and I
OL,8,Ftake them extremely seriously. I am
OL,9,Fdetermined to see this work through and
OL,10,Fbuild a council residents can have
OL,11,Fconfidence in, and be proud of."
OL,13,FThe authority has been given 10 working
OL,14,Fdays to respond to the Ministry of
OL,15,FHousing, Communities and Local
OL,16,FGovernment (MHCLG).
